@*
    What an unauthenticated visitor sees instead of a page they cannot have. Not a 403 page: the
    dashboard is behind a sign-in, and saying so is not a leak, because the page exists for everyone.
*@
<section class="app-page">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span>Protected route</span> Identity is only an input</p>
    <h1>You need to sign in</h1>

    <p>
        The operations dashboard is scoped to whichever organization you belong to, so it needs to know
        who you are.
    </p>

    <p><a class="app-cta" href="/signin">Sign in</a></p>
</section>
